      "review_description": "Worst company to deal with . We got a 5 KW solar system installed by them. From day 1 inverter was faulty and installation team was very unprofessional . We asked them to show the license but they started making excuses as none of them was an accredited installer . But we already paid the deposit so we couldn't think much . They asked us to pay on the same day after installation. But honestly the installation was so bad and roof got damaged which we checked after two days and got leakage problems . We are still dealing with them, trying to call and email them but no one is answering back. Worst company to deal with, my inverter is still faulty and they don't pick up the call and if you call them and by chance they pick up .. they put you on hold for hours and hours. Please don't waste your money!",
