      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I was dealing with Amy Amrev (Sales).  Amy, in my opinion, went above and beyond trying to ensure that I had the system that was correct for my needs.  I did at least three months of research before I purchased this system.  Amy had a great knowledge of her products.On a number of occasions, Amy went back to her Manager to secure me a deal that involved particular items that I wanted.  She even went so far as to contact me on her day off (when she was away sick) knowing that I was waiting for her response.  That shows a lot of dedication.Also, as Dr Green is situated in the Metro area's (and I live in the Country), Amy also tried to find local installers to help with local product warranty.  In the end, none of the local installers were responding and I decided (to save some time) to go with Dr Green's installation team.The system has been booked in for installation later this week.  As long as it goes in smoothly (I don't anticipate any problems at this time), then I will have the system installed well within the timeframes specified (even though it is very close to Christmas and they are extremely busy).",
